# IMAGE TOOLS

Registered tools for the image domain operate over a preserved
image file and its derived records:
- compute_custody_hash / validate_format — integrity and
  anti-spoofing gates; run before trusting contents.
- extract_exif / extract_deep_metadata — metadata records; report
  verbatim, do not reinterpret units or coordinates.
- run_consistency — timestamp reconciliation.
- analyze_ela / detect_eof_anomaly — alteration indicators.
- run_ocr / run_vision_ensemble — visible text and visual clues.
- reverse_geocode / resolve_telemetry — location resolution.
- verify_c2pa — provenance signature state.
- discover_sources — reverse source discovery where authorized.
- detect_contradictions / aggregate_consensus / fuse_geolocation —
  cross-layer reasoning over all evidence.

Call these tools in investigation order. Never invent a metadata
value, coordinate, or detection that a tool did not return.
